name: Scoped configuration signals retain bounded inspection gaps through Review, Report and restart
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/iac_inspection.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET/repository
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
paste-file: @ART/direct-command.txt
keys: Enter
wait: 0.5
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 coverage is incomplete | partial-inspection
expect: Dockerfile.oversized
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/iac_inspection.py @TMP_TARGET @ART partial
nav-mode:
keys: z
require-live-snap: 20 READ TRANSCRIPT | inspection-reader
resize: 160x48
live-snap: inspection-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: inspection-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: inspection-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: inspection-60x20
resize: 40x12
keys: End
live-snap: inspection-40x12-tail
keys: PPage
live-snap: inspection-40x12-page-1
keys: PPage
live-snap: inspection-40x12-page-2
keys: PPage
live-snap: inspection-40x12-page-3
keys: PPage
live-snap: inspection-40x12-page-4
ask: Are actual inspection limits, exclusions, skipped file and partial coverage reachable at all six sizes with no verified-vulnerability or complete-repository claim?
keys: q
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape C-u
paste-file: @ART/scan-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 cached via context:build | cached-context-choice
keys: r
wait: 0.5
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 30 content bytes read | shared-scan-inspection
expect: Dockerfile.oversized
expect-not: prerequisite chain aborted after sast:scan failed
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/iac_inspection.py @TMP_TARGET @ART scanned
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 signal-only | policy-finding
expect: selected/Dockerfile
submit: decision deferred Owned image policy requires owner review
require-live-snap: 25 Owned image policy | deferred
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 1 reviewed · 0 confirmed | report
keys: s j j j Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/iac_inspection.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
ask: Does one consolidated policy signal retain the selected path, source SHA, scripted deferral and incomplete inspection through Report without discovering the excluded parent file?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET/repository
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 30 Owned image policy | restarted-decision
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/iac_inspection.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
